OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition celebrates 171-year-old
OL,4,Acemetery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition has been created to
OL,7,Fhonour and celebrate people of note
OL,8,Fburied in a 171-year-old cemetery,
OL,9,Fincluding a brewery founder and a
OL,10,Freligious leader.
OL,12,FEleven new boards now grace the walls
OL,13,Fof the visitor centre in Foster Hill
OL,14,FRoad Cemetery, Bedford, that will be
OL,15,Fopen on Saturday and Sunday as part of
OL,16,FHeritage Open Days.
OL,18,FOne is about the book The Wisdom of
OL,19,FSally Red Shoes, written by Bedford
OL,20,Fauthor, Ruth Hogan, that was inspired
OL,21,Fby her regular walks around the site.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
